/**
 * The logged-in (or logging-in) session. Share it with [`crate::CoreApi`] (`CoreApi(session:)`),
 * [`crate::CoreHttp`] (`CoreHttp(session:)`), and [`crate::CoreEngine`] (`CoreEngine(session:host:)`).
 */
